Value Required VERSION ([^,\s]+)
Value HOSTNAME (\S+)
Value UPTIME (\S.*?)
Value MODEL (\S+)
Value SERIAL (\S+)

Start
  ^.*Software.*,\s+Version\s+${VERSION}(?:[,\s].*)?$$
  ^${HOSTNAME}\s+uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$
  ^[Cc]isco\s+${MODEL}\s+\(.+\)\s+processor\b
  ^Processor\s+board\s+ID\s+${SERIAL}\s*$$
